  "top10": {
    "introHtml": "<p>Refresh: Aug 15 2026. Searched 3 sources (Cars.com, CarGurus, AutoTrader) within 35 mi of ZIP 19063, $7K\u2013$15K, 4+ seat convertibles. TrueCar skipped (body-style filter broken). Excluded 2-seaters: BMW Z3, Audi TT Roadster, Ford Thunderbird (2002), Saturn Sky. CarGurus SL-Class excluded (2-seater). No confirmed manual-transmission listings surfaced this refresh (see Manual tab). Top 10 ranked by condition signals, model reliability, and local availability.</p>",
    "picks": [
      {
        "rank": 1,
        "year": 2013,
        "make": "BMW",
        "model": "3 Series",
        "trim": "328i Convertible",
        "price": 13594,
        "mileage": 51385,
        "location": "Elkton, MD",
        "distanceMi": 30,
        "dealer": "Hertrich Ford of Elkton",
        "source": "cargurus",
        "dealRating": "Good Deal",
        "transmission": null,
        "imageUrl": "https://static.cargurus.com/images/forsale/2026/08/14/14/00/2013_bmw_3_series-pic-354978203819722111-1024x768.jpeg",
        "url": "https://www.cargurus.com/details/455459360",
        "whyGood": "E93 328i is the sweet spot of the E9x run \u2014 inline-6 power, proper rear-wheel drive, and a proven folding soft-top. 51k miles is exceptional for a 2013 at this price. Good Deal badge confirms it's priced below market. The E93 top mechanism is robust when maintained; check for service records on top motor and hydraulics.",
        "whatToVerify": "Full top cycle front-to-back and back-to-front; headliner/rear carpet for water stains; rocker panel rust (especially seam behind front wheel); oil-cooler line condition; valve-cover gasket weep; soft-top rear-window seam integrity.",
        "bottomLine": "Best combination of model reliability, low mileage, and verified market pricing in this refresh."
      },
      {
        "rank": 2,
        "year": 2009,
        "make": "Mercedes-Benz",
        "model": "CLK-Class",
        "trim": "CLK 350 Cabriolet",
        "price": 11470,
        "mileage": 65450,
        "location": "Media, PA",
        "distanceMi": 2,
        "dealer": "Selden Motors",
        "source": "cargurus",
        "dealRating": "Good Deal",
        "transmission": "Automatic",
        "imageUrl": "https://static.cargurus.com/images/forsale/2026/07/12/06/37/2009_mercedes-benz_clk-pic-5147648557516517479-1024x768.jpeg",
        "url": "https://www.cargurus.com/details/453249815",
        "whyGood": "W209 CLK350 Cabriolet \u2014 the last-gen CLK \u2014 has the 3.5L V6, a premium interior, and a proper 4-seat layout with a fabric top that folds cleanly. 65k miles is low for age. Two miles from Media means quick test drive. Selden Motors is a known local independent.",
        "whatToVerify": "Full top cycle including tonneau cover and header-rail latches; rear-window delamination check; ABC hydraulic fluid level and hose condition (if ABC suspension); front motor mount condition; check for HVAC blend-door issues common on this gen.",
        "bottomLine": "Low-mileage CLK just 2 miles away \u2014 the closest thing to a 'found it in the neighbor's garage' buy in this search."
      },
      {
        "rank": 3,
        "year": 2012,
        "make": "Audi",
        "model": "A5",
        "trim": "2.0T Premium Plus Cabriolet",
        "price": 12999,
        "mileage": 55600,
        "location": "",
        "distanceMi": null,
        "dealer": "Peruzzi Mazda",
        "source": "autotrader",
        "dealRating": null,
        "transmission": "Automatic",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.autotrader.com/hn/c/1b827306786d42be982805eff02276e5.jpg",
        "url": "https://www.autotrader.com/cars-for-sale/vehicle/787462594",
        "whyGood": "B8 A5 Cabriolet is one of the best-looking 4-seat soft-tops made \u2014 solid steel feel when closed, well-lined interior, and the 2.0T is a known quantity at this mileage. Premium Plus adds heated seats, xenons, and Bose. 55k miles is on the low end for a 2012 at this price.",
        "whatToVerify": "Timing chain tensioner rattle on cold start (known 2.0T issue); top seals around rear-quarter windows; roof-rail drain tubes (clog = water intrusion); Haldex fluid if AWD; check for any oil-consumption test history.",
        "bottomLine": "Style-leader pick \u2014 under 56k miles, well-equipped, at a solid price from a franchised dealer."
      },
      {
        "rank": 4,
        "year": 2017,
        "make": "Audi",
        "model": "A3",
        "trim": "2.0T Cabriolet Premium",
        "price": 14124,
        "mileage": 88594,
        "location": "Wynnewood, PA",
        "distanceMi": 10,
        "dealer": "Main Line Auto Group",
        "source": "cargurus",
        "dealRating": "Good Deal",
        "transmission": "Automatic",
        "imageUrl": "https://static.cargurus.com/images/forsale/2026/08/11/04/00/2017_audi_a3-pic-2434630225716001756-1024x768.jpeg",
        "url": "https://www.cargurus.com/details/454248442",
        "whyGood": "Newest car in the search by a wide margin. The 8V A3 Cabriolet is a tight, modern 4-seat drop-top with MMI infotainment, virtual cockpit optional, and the reliable EA888 2.0T. 10 miles away in Wynnewood. Good Deal pricing for a 2017 with under 90k.",
        "whatToVerify": "DSG fluid service history; soft-top rear-window yellowing (common on early 8V builds); check rear-seat headroom is acceptable for intended passengers; side-mirror folding function; any extended-warranty coverage remaining.",
        "bottomLine": "Most modern, most feature-rich convertible in the dataset \u2014 good choice if daily-driver comfort matters as much as fun."
      },
      {
        "rank": 5,
