        "imageUrl": "https://platform.cstatic-images.com/large/in/v2/220992f4-6d7b-5a84-999a-0c3c413cdc94/564cee7d-5505-4712-8a54-7f364740f431/TWUJbSHF9Ip8hGWCmQukBmMLH-E.jpg",
        "url": "https://www.cars.com/vehicledetail/dabcb463-e945-41fc-b07c-dd08637d350a/",
        "whyGood": "Supercharged 3.0 V6 in an S5 Cabriolet is the performance wild card of this search. 333hp, quattro AWD, and the premium interior of the B8 chassis. 69k miles is moderate. Harder to find than the A5 and commands a slight premium \u2014 the clean-title no-accidents filter on Cars.com gives extra confidence.",
        "whatToVerify": "Supercharger belt and tensioner condition; oil separator/PCV system (known wear item); top mechanism \u2014 S5 uses the same hydraulic soft-top as A5, check fluid and pump; rear-quarter window seals; quattro rear diff fluid.",
        "bottomLine": "The horsepower bargain of the bunch \u2014 supercharged V6 AWD drop-top under $14k."
      },
      {
        "rank": 6,
        "year": 2015,
        "make": "BMW",
        "model": "428i",
