        "url": "https://www.cars.com/vehicledetail/5552573a-5c2e-4031-87c7-f4fdf0f4701f/",
        "whyGood": "F33 428i xDrive is the most modern BMW soft-top in the search \u2014 iDrive, better chassis dynamics than the E9x, and AWD is a practical bonus for shoulder-season top-down driving. Under $10k for a 2015 is strong value even at 120k miles.",
        "whatToVerify": "Top mechanism and rear-window heating element; N20 engine timing chain (known issue on early builds \u2014 check for rattle on startup); xDrive transfer case fluid; check for any SULEV emissions equipment condition; roof-rail drain tubes.",
        "bottomLine": "Most modern BMW here at the lowest BMW price \u2014 good value pick if you want current-gen features."
