        "whyGood": "Private-sale 2016 A3 Cabriolet \u2014 one year newer than the CarGurus A3, same platform, similar price. Private sellers often maintained for personal use vs fleet. Clean-title no-accidents flag from Cars.com. 16 miles away in Whitemarsh.",
