        "whyGood": "2006 650i Cabriolet with only 44k miles is the lowest-mileage car in the entire search. The N62 V8 sounds great and the E64 is a grand-tourer with genuine rear seats. Private seller in Manayunk, 12 miles away. The low miles are the headline story here.",
